# Canonical author identity for `git log`, `git shortlog` and `git blame`.
#
# From 2026-08-09 (4e28a321) to 2026-09-15 this repository's local git config carried
# a test fixture's identity, so 1,133 commits were authored "Fixture". History is not
# rewritten -- that would move every SHA cited by tags, build stamps and the tracker --
# so the display is mapped instead (HOOK-GIT-ENV-SCRUB-2026-09-15).
